 61CU c  1990Sz01: E=3.67-3.83 MeV. Measured |s(E), |g(|q); deduced IAS. See    
 61CU2c  also 1993Ca12 for the assignment of spins of resonances deduced using  
 61CU3c  multi-dimensional scaling method for |g-ray data                       
 61CU c  1989Ti01: E=1-4 MeV. Measured |g-ray yields, resonance strengths       
 61CU c  1989Iz01, 1989IzZZ: E=5 MeV. Measured |g(|q)                           
 61CU c  1988Iz01: E=1.931-2.455 MeV. Measured |g spectra, |g(|q)               
 61CU c  1983Si06: E=1.57-3.45 MeV, measured |g-multiplicity, |s(E). See also   
 61CU2c  1989Si25 for analysis of data                                          
 61CU c  1981By03: E=1.57-1.85 MeV, measured E|g, I|g, |g(|q)                   
 61CU c  1979Bo09: E=1.80-2.90 MeV. Measured |s(E), E|g, I|g                    
 61CU c  1977Ho29: E=3.5-4.1 MeV, measured |s(E)                                
 61CU c  1976Be30: E=3.69-3.79 MeV, measured E|g, I|g, absolute |g yields       
 61CU c  1976Kr19: E=1.57-1.90 MeV, measured E|g, |g(|q)                        
 61CU c  1975Kr06: E<5 MeV, measured |s(E)                                      
 61CU c  1975Kr05: E=1674, 1856, 1873 keV, measured |s(E|g), deduced B(M1)      
 61CU c  1974Kr26: E=1588, 1599, 1605, 1620 keV, measured E|g, I|g              
 61CU c  1974Tr03: E=1840-1880, 2220-2300 keV, measured E|g, |g(|q), |s         
 61CU c  1974Ad06: E=3.67-3.95 MeV, measured E|g, I|g, |g(|q), |s(E)            
 61CU c  1973Tr06: E=1.5-1.9 MeV, measured E|g, |g(|q), |s(E)                   
 61CU c  1972Sz01: Measured |s(E)                                               
 61CU c  1971Ki29: E=1588-1620 keV, measured E|g, |g(|q), |s(E)                 
 61CU c  1965Go02: E=1588, 1599, 1620 keV; measured p|g|g(|q)                   
 61CU c  1957Bu64: E=0.7-1.8 MeV. 54 proton resonances from 725 to 1793 keV.    
 61CU2c  Measured yields, primary and secondary E|g, I|g                        
 61CU c  1989Iz01, 1988Iz01, 1983Si06, 1981By03, 1976Kr19, 1975Kr06, 1975Kr05,  
 61CU2c  and 1974Kr26 are from the same group                                   
 61CU c  1974Tr03 and 1973Tr06 are from the same group                          
 61CU c  1965Go02 and 1957Bu64 are from the same group                          
 61CU c  Measured |s(E), scin. Measured E|g, I|g, semi, enriched target.        
 61CU2c  E(p)=1800-2900 (1979Bo09), E(p)=3690-3790 (1976Be30), E=1930-2450      
 61CU3c  (1988Iz01), E=1020-4420 (1989Ti01), E=1599-3407 (1983Si06).            
 61CU c  Measured |s(E), scin. Measured E|g, I|g, |g(|q), semi, enriched        
 61CU2c  target. E(p)=1550-1950                                                 
 61CU3c  (1971Ki29,1973Tr06,1974Tr03,1974Kr26,1975Kr05,1975Kr06,1976Kr19),      
 61CU4c  E(p)=2220-2300 (1974Tr03), E(p)=3620-3830                              
 61CU5c  (1972Sz01,1974Ad06,1977Ho29,1990Sz01), E=1000-4000 (1989Ti01).         
 61CU c  Measured |s(E), E|g, I|g, |g(|q), scin. E(p)=700-1800 (1957Bu64),      
 61CU2c  E=1930-2450 (1988Iz01).                                                
